           <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">First written evidence of the use of anatomical terms and physiological concepts. This knowledge is contained in the ancient "Egyptian medical papyri," most notably: the (Edwin) Smith Papyrus.</p>
          </div>
         </div>
        </div><!-- Image Placeholder 1 -->
