         <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem;"><span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🧠</span>
          <div>
           <h3 style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--syd-gold); font-size: 1.125rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;">Early Understanding</h3>
           <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Without human dissection, they considered the heart the source of thought, emotion, bodily fluids, and the soul ("metw"), misunderstanding veins, tendons, and nerves as vessels.</p>
          </div>
         </div>
        </div><!-- Fun Fact -->
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--syd-maroon), #A01D47); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1rem; text-align: center;">
